\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
I simply must make another ‘fish in water’ comment here.
 It is this:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Quote

\emph on
Hopping around in code is the antithesis of good programming.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
We’ve already seen two different options:
\end_layout

